{{also|þyþa}}
==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈθiːða/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|iːða}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|þýða}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*þiudijaną}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-weak|þýddi|þýtt}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|takes the accusative}} to [[translate]] a language
#: ''Gætirðu '''þýtt''' þetta fyrir mig?''
#:: Could you '''translate''' this for me?
# to [[mean]], to [[signify]]
#: ''Hvað '''þýðir''' þetta?''
#:: What does this '''mean'''?

=====Conjugation=====
{{is-conj-w2|þ|ý|ð}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|to translate}} {{l|is|snúa}}, {{l|is|snara}}, {{l|is|útleggja}}
* {{sense|to mean}} {{l|is|merkja}}

====See also====
* {{l|is|þýðing|pos=n}}
* {{l|is|benda til}}
* {{l|is|gefa í skyn}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|is|non|þýða||kindness; affection}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|f|þýðu|-}}

# [[gentleness]], [[kindness]]

=====Declension=====
{{is-decl-noun-f-w1|þ|ý|ð|pl=-}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|is|þýður}}

